# Everything the image does not need. Keeping this tight matters for build
# speed: the whole context is sent to the daemon before anything runs.
.git
.github
.githooks
# Local-only working documents. The published image is the final stage, which
# copies only the binary, so these could never reach it anyway -- but they have
# no business in the build context either. Kept in step with .gitignore.
private
CLAUDE.md
*.local.md
config.local.yml
documentation
web/node_modules
internal/api/webui/dist
Makefile.local
solarr
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
config.yml
scripts
